IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-KVCOMM-SHARING.

DATA DIVISION.
01 AGENT-ID            PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN   PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 SHARED-LEN          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PREFILL-SAVED-PCT   PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-KVCOMM.
    IF PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    # R2 = (PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN > 4) ? (PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN - 4) : 1
    MOVE PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN TO SHARED-LEN.
    IF PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN > 4
        SUBTRACT 4 FROM SHARED-LEN.
    ELSE
        MOVE 1 TO SHARED-LEN.
    END-IF.

    # R3 = (SHARED-LEN * 100) / PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN
    MOVE SHARED-LEN TO PREFILL-SAVED-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY PREFILL-SAVED-PCT.
    DIVIDE PROMPT-TOKENS-LEN INTO PREFILL-SAVED-PCT.

    SET depth 2.
    WEIGHT 32 PREFILL-SAVED-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 SHARED-LEN.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
